Overview – About This Report and the Combined Management’s Report

Content and Structure

This integrated BASF Report 2024 documents BASF’s economic, environmental and social performance
in 2024. Published each year in German and English, the BASF annual report shows how we as a
company create value for our stakeholders and how sustainability contributes to BASF’s long-term
suc</data>
