Organization of the BASF Group as of January 1, 2025

As part of the implementation of the new strategy, the Catalysts division was restructured, effective
January 1, 2025; as a result, the Surface Technologies segment will now comprise three standalone
businesses going forward instead of two: The Coatings division will remain unchanged, while the
Battery Materials and Environm</data>
