      <data key="d2">19</data>
      <data key="d3">At a Glance           Combined Management’s Report      Consolidated Financial Statements          Further Information

supplier target and are now focusing on improving the sustainability performance of those suppliers
whose audit results were inadequate.

In the future, BASF will place a greater focus on cash generation. We aim to demonstrate a high degree
of capital discipline through considerably lower capital expenditures and the consistent implementation
of our cost savings programs (for m</data>
    </node>
