      <data key="d3">At a Glance           Combined Management’s Report      Consolidated Financial Statements          Further Information

To focus more strongly on cash generation and strengthen our capital discipline, we are changing our
internal steering processes for capital and resource allocation. We are moving from a largely project-
based approach at BASF Group level to a strategic allocation approach for our divisions. We have
developed medium-term value creation plans for the divisions based on their res</data>
