      <data key="d2">24</data>
      <data key="d3">g them with regional market requirements, as
demonstrated by the capacity expansions at the Verbund site in Antwerp, Belgium and the adapted
vision for the future of the Verbund in Ludwigshafen, Germany (for more information, see page 14).

Materials

In terms of production capacity, the Materials segment is a global leader in high-performance plastics
and precursors and home to two divisions from BASF’s core businesses. The Monomers division has a
broad portfolio of large-volume monomers and ba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="BASF SE - 2024 - BASF Report (SustainabilityReports.com).pdf:page_25:chunk_1">
