The Materials segment combines expertise in basic chemicals with a diverse range of high-performance
specialties and successfully operates some of BASF’s most profitable value chains, including methylene
diphenyl diisocyanate (MDI). Throughout the chemical cycle, the Materials segment plays an important
role in BASF’s portfolio with its high cash flow and earnings contributions</data>
