      <data key="d3">ns. The segment holds one of three top market positions with regard to production capacities
in around 80% of its business areas, including polyamide 6, thermoplastic polyurethanes, polyurethane
systems and engineering plastics.

Industrial Solutions

The Industrial Solutions segment is a part of the BASF Group’s core businesses and markets and
develops ingredients and additives for industrial applications. The customers of its two operating
divisions, Dispersions &amp; Resins and Performance Chemic</data>
    </node>
