Nutrition &amp; Care

The Nutrition &amp; Care segment is also part our core portfolio. The Care Chemicals and Nutrition &amp; Health
divisions provide highly attractive and resilient markets with high-quality, high-performance products.
Future growth in these markets will be driven by rising consumer awareness of sustainable product
solutions with lower carbon footprints and the demand fo</data>
    </node>
    <node id="BASF SE - 2024 - BASF Report (SustainabilityReports.com).pdf:page_26:chunk_2">
      <data key="d0">chunk</data>
