      <data key="d2">26</data>
      <data key="d3">ision serves a variety of markets,
such as bioprocessing and formulation of vaccines and antibodies.

The basis for this segment’s business are highly competitive, world-scale plants that are deeply
embedded in the BASF Verbund.

Surface Technologies

Some of our standalone businesses are bundled in the Surface Technologies segment, which consisted
of the Catalysts and the Coatings divisions until the end of 2024. Together with our customers, we
develop novel products and technologies for cataly</data>
