Our Steering Concept

We have firmly anchored our goal of achieving profitable growth while
creating value for society and our shareholders in our strategy. For this
reason, both financial and sustainability-related indicators are an integral
part of our steering system. With our Differentiated Steering approach, we
aim to increase the competitiveness of our business units and </data>
    </node>
