current operating assets, are controlled directly via two indicators:

– Income from operations before depreciation, amortization and special items
  (EBITDA before special items)

– Free cash flow

Return on capital employed (ROCE) is significantly influenced by strategic decisions such as acquisitions,
divestitures and investments. It remains a medium-term key financial target for the BASF Group. This is
reflected in our ROCE target of aroun</data>
