Value-based management throughout the company

The target agreement process is an important part of our value-based management. Since 2024, variable
compensation for senior executives has been based on targets derived from the key performance
indicators for the steering of the respective business unit and the BASF Group. We plan to introduce this
differentiated bonus system for</data>
