CO2 equivalents (for more information, see page 178 onward).

Calculation of ROCE and cost of capital

ROCE is calculated as the EBIT of the segments as a percentage of the average cost of capital basis.

To calculate the EBIT of the segments, we take the BASF Group’s EBIT and deduct the EBIT of activities
recognized under Other, which are not allocated to the divisions.

The cost of capital basis is calculated using the month-end figures and consis</data>
