      <data key="d2">30</data>
      <data key="d3">ent to the cost of capital percentage. The cost of equity is ascertained using
the capital asset pricing model. Borrowing costs are determined based on the financing costs of the
BASF Group. The cost of capital percentage for 2025 is 10% (2024: 10%).

