Trends in the chemical industry

Despite significant regional differences, growth in the global chemical industry in 2024 (+3.9%)
considerably outpaced overall industrial production. While the chemical industry in China grew by around
6.8%a on the basis of official figures, it increased by 1.1% in the rest of the world. In 2024, China
accounted for 86% of global chemical growth</data>
