      <data key="d2">56</data>
      <data key="d3">These are issued in euros
and other currencies with different maturities as part of our €20 billion debt issuance program. The goal
is to create a balanced maturity profile, diversify our financing and optimize our debt capital financing
conditions.

For short-term financing, we use BASF SE’s global commercial paper program, which has an issuing
volume of up to $12.5 billion. As of December 31, 2024, no commercial paper was outstanding under this
program. A firmly committed, syndicated credit li</data>
    </node>
