      <data key="d2">56</data>
      <data key="d3">p, we bundle the financing, financial
investments and foreign currency hedging of BASF SE’s subsidiaries within the BASF Group where
possible. Foreign currency risks are primarily hedged centrally using derivative financial instruments in
the market.

Our interest risk management generally pursues the goal of reducing interest expenses for the
BASF Group and limiting interest risks. Interest rate hedging transactions are therefore conducted with

