Earnings in the Surface Technologies segment were slightly below the prior-year figure. We originally
expected EBITDA before special items at the prior-year level. This decrease was caused by a sharp
earnings decline in the Catalysts division, which primarily resulted from lower precious metal prices and
volumes. We had expected a slight increase in earnings. In the Coatings di</data>
