Forecast

We expect global GDP growth of 2.6% and industrial growth of 2.4%.
Demand for goods is therefore expected to have a somewhat stronger
significance for economic development than in 2024. In this economic
environment, we expect chemical production to grow by 3.0%. The
macroeconomic risks are high in view of geopolitical conflicts and
increasing protectionist tendencies.</data>
