Growth in the global chemical industry (excluding pharmaceuticals) is expected to be slightly lower
(3.0%) in 2025 compared with 2024 (+3.9%). We anticipate weak growth in the advanced economies
following stagnation in the previous year (2025: +0.8%, 2024: +0.1%). Expansion in the emerging
markets is expected to slow slightly (2025: +3.9%, 202</data>
