Significant features of the internal control and risk management system with
regard to the Group financial reporting process

The Combined Management’s Report and the Consolidated Financial Statements are prepared by a unit
in the Corporate Finance department. The Consolidated Financial Statements are derived from the
separate financial statements of the subsidiaries and joint </data>
