Long-term demand development

We assume that growth in chemical production (excluding pharmaceuticals) will be slightly higher than
that of global gross domestic product in the coming years. With our market-oriented and broad portfolio,
which we will continue to strengthen in the years ahead, through investments in new production
capacities, t</data>
