BASF SE and reporting on the company’s financial and nonfinancial performance as well as half-year and
quarterly reporting. Furthermore, it must ensure that the company’s activities comply with the applicable
legislation and regulatory requirements as well as internal corporate requirements (compliance). This
includes the establishment of appropriate systems for control, compli</data>
