      <data key="d3">nt about the item on the agenda under discussion. Registered shareholders are also
entitled to file motions pertaining to proposals for resolutions made by the Board of Executive Directors
and Supervisory Board at the Annual Shareholders’ Meeting and

to contest resolutions of the meeting
and have them evaluated for their lawfulness in court. Shareholders who hold at least €500,000 of the
company’s share capital, a quota corresponding to 390,625 shares, are furthermore entitled to request
that a</data>
    </node>
