Implementation of the German Corporate Governance Code (GCGC)

BASF advocates responsible corporate governance that focuses on sustainably increasing the value of
the company. BASF SE follows all of the recommendations of the German Corporate Governance Code
in the version dated April 28, 2022 (Code 2022), the version in force at the time of submitting the
Declaration of Confor</data>
    </node>
