      <data key="d3">lders are not entitled to receive share
certificates (issuance of share certificates). There are neither different classes of shares nor shares with
preferential voting rights.

Appointment and dismissal of members of the Board of Executive Directors

The appointment and dismissal of members of the Board of Executive Directors is legally governed by
the regulations in Article 39 of the SE Council Regulation, section 16 of the SE Implementation Act and
sections 84 and 85 AktG as well as Article 7</data>
