      <data key="d3">In September 2024, we communicated our “Winning Ways” strategy both internally and externally. The
strategy revolves around our ambition to be the preferred chemical company to enable our customers’
green transformation (see page 18). To support this ambition, we supply our customers with products
that contribute to sustainability, either through their use by the customer or through their reduced carbon
footprint (see page 194). Many of our customers have set their own sustainability-related tar</data>
