      <data key="d3">t was obtained, for example, from our
Advisory Councils, from the BASF Civil Society Forum and via discussions in multistakeholder networks.
Indirect input consisted of big data analyses of the interests of customers and capital markets, for
example.

Based on the compiled sustainability matters, we worked with in-house experts and selected
stakeholders in our Nature Advisory Council and our Human Rights Advisory Council to identify and
validate the risks and opportunities associated with the co</data>
    </node>
