reported for the 2024 business year (see page 49 of the BASF Report 2023). No entity-specific topics
beyond the ones defined in the ESRSs were identified in the assessment for 2024.

As a manufacturing company, the main impacts of our business relate to climate change (mainly due to
our energy requirements), other environmental matters (emissions to air, water and biodiversity) and our
