to create resilience. As a company that is active in a very wide variety of different regions and business
areas, we take a diversified approach to climate change adaptation.

We use our TripleS method (Sustainable Solution Steering, see page 161) to continuously review the
resilience of our product portfolio with respect to environmental and social matters. We do this by
categorizing our products into different segments</data>
