Scope 1 and 2
Based on the 2018 base year, we want to achieve a 25% reduction in greenhouse gas emissions from
our production processes (Scope 1) and our energy purchases (Scope 2) by 2030.23 Our target focuses
on emissions caused by our production and includes 96% of our gross Scope 1 emissions and 99% of
our gross Scope 2 emissions. This means that we aim to reduce greenhouse</data>
