Our emissions to air and wastewater are subject to stringent controls. We assess their impact carefully
and in compliance with applicable laws and regulations. In this context, we also evaluate whether
regulatory developments concerning emissions to air and water require investments in our infrastructure
and the further development of our systems. The chemical industry is facin</data>
