carried out in 2024. In addition, responsible local authorities regularly inspect whether the analyses and
safety precautions at our sites comply with internal and legal requirements.

In developing our business strategies, we also consider the resilience of our business models with regard
to economic, ecological and social aspects, as well as their impacts, risks and opportunities. As part of
our opportunity and risk management </data>
