      <data key="d1">BASF SE - 2024 - BASF Report (SustainabilityReports.com).pdf</data>
      <data key="d2">209</data>
      <data key="d3">available technology. We document contamination risks and the status of soil and
groundwater for our sites worldwide in a database. Ongoing remediation work continued on schedule in
the reporting year and planning was completed for further measures.

BASF Report 2024                                                                                                         Sustainability Statement 209</data>
    </node>
