In order to minimize the impact of substances of concern and substances of very high concern on human
health and the environment in the downstream value chain, such substances are used in accordance
with statutory requirements, such as the EU’s REACH regulation. In addition, our TripleS method for
steering the sustainability performance of our product portfolio (see page 161) t</data>
    </node>
