and leakages. Alongside production at our plants and the activities at our sites and warehouses, this also
applies to the procurement and transport of our raw materials as well as the distribution and usage of our
products.

For our upstream value chain, our procurement organization has established guidelines in a global risk-
based management system that define how we implement our due diligence processes. We have defined
corresponding standards in a global requiremen</data>
    </node>
