Substances of concern or of very high concern

E2-5

Substances of concern or of very high concern may represent an integral component of the chemical raw
materials used for production or of chemical products. To this extent, a portion of our products, which
are key input products in further industrial or professional value creation or application, contain
substances of concern</data>
    </node>
