the GHS framework if applicable, such as the EU’s regulation on the classification, labeling and
packaging of substances and mixtures (CLP Regulation).

If necessary, we advise our customers on product safety. We set global requirements on the safe
transport of dangerous goods for our logistics providers (see page 213). We also train our employees
worldwide on the proper handling and usage of selec</data>
