E3 Water

ESRS E3

Water is of fundamental importance in chemical production along the
entire value chain. It is used as a coolant, solvent and cleaning agent, and
to make our products. Waterways are used to transport goods. At the
same time, water is a scarce commodity in an increasing number of
regions. That is why we promote the responsible use of this resource with
sustaina</data>
