Water protection in our production
We aim to reduce negative impacts on water availability caused by water abstraction in our own
production. Likewise, we also strive to reduce water pollution from regular emissions to water. This
requires a holistic approach and continuous control.

That is why we have established comprehensive management and control systems for our own
produc</data>
