E4 Biodiversity and Ecosystems

ESRS E4

Biodiversity is under threat. It is the foundation for functioning
ecosystems. As a chemical company, we use valuable natural resources
such as water, air and soil. At the same time, our business activities have
an impact on these resources, for example through emissions to the
environment or the sourcing of renewable raw materials.

