Strategy and governance

E4-1

We are currently undergoing a transformation toward climate neutrality and observance of the planetary
boundaries. To this end, we have set ourselves ambitious targets (see page 31) that impact our business
models and our strategy as well as how they interface with nature, biodiversity and ecosystems.

– We strive to use more and more renewable al</data>
