      <data key="d2">233</data>
      <data key="d3">and to drive necessary actions forward. In the event that our business activities negatively
impact or could negatively impact affected communities, we involve them or their representatives in one
of our stakeholder engagement formats (see page 308).

We generally consider the resilience of our business models at the level of our business units or
operating divisions along the value chain (see page 169). The current resilience of our business models in
relation to biodiversity and ecosystems was</data>
