newly extracted raw materials. If fewer fossil raw materials are extracted or renewable raw materials
harvested, this reduces the negative impacts on humans and the environment.

As part of our Responsible Care Management System, for example, we review the effectiveness of our
measures in terms of combating these impacts. We analyze our impacts in the downstream value chain
by means of the TripleS method. We have set oursel</data>
