E5 Resource Use and Circular Economy

ESRS E5

As the world’s population grows, so does demand for limited natural
resources. At the same time, many valuable materials end up in landfill or
in waste incineration. Using resources responsibly and closing loops are
material for our business and achieving our sustainability targets.

In our double materiality assessment, the topic </data>
