The global procurement requirement is supplemented by specific internal guidelines, for example, on
sourcing palm-based raw materials or certain mineral raw materials. The requirements regulate the
sourcing of raw materials in general. They do not address a reduction in the use of fossil raw materials.
As part of our new corporate strategy, the BASF Renewable Carbon unit within</data>
    </node>
