in many areas, for example to include Ccycled® automotive reﬁnish coatings, biomass balanced products
for customers from the detergent and cleaner industry, and products for selected chemical
intermediates.

One focal point of our activities in the area of circular feedstocks is the chemical recycling of plastics.
We use this complementary technology to mechanical recycling to help reduce the amount of plastic
waste that is disposed of in landfills or </data>
