      <data key="d3">In addition to this target, with which we aim to increase the proportion of our more sustainable products,
we have set ourselves a new target for the circular economy in 2024. The target was set by BASF’s
Board of Executive Directors in 2024 on the basis of the TripleS method. This methodology and the
associated target are based on clearly defined criteria in the respective ESG topic areas that are
comprehensible in the methodology manual. There is currently no general quantitative scientific
fr</data>
