aim with this target is to reduce waste along the value chain and to make a positive contribution to the
more efficient use of raw materials. The annual review of our TripleS target also

includes a review of
those products that contribute to the circular economy target, so as to measure and evaluate our
progress toward achieving it.

In this way, BASF is pursuing a holistic strategy to support a circular economy and at the same tim</data>
