      <data key="d3">d integration, we can produce feedstocks for our value chains efficiently within the
BASF Verbund while conserving resources. We continuously evaluate whether fossil and petrochemical
resources can be replaced with renewable or recycled alternatives.

Our renewable raw materials are mainly based on vegetable oils, fats, grains, sugar and ethanol. We use
these to produce ingredients for the detergent and cleaner industry and natural active ingredients for the
cosmetics industry, for example. We a</data>
    </node>
