2024, which we generally also use in the same year. Renewable raw materials accounted for 1.2 million
metric tons of this amount and were mainly based on vegetable oils, fats, grains and sugar.

We purchase renewable raw materials in accordance with our principles for sustainable sourcing. Our
expectations of our suppliers are laid down in our Supplier Code of Conduct. We are developing and
testing approaches to make the supply of raw mate</data>
