   definitively clarified. For this reason, BASF products based on chemically recycled raw materials were
  not considered further in the assessment either. Mechanical recycling did not play any role for BASF in
   this context.

In the second step, it was assessed whether the potentially taxonomy-aligned products make a
substantial contribution to climate change mitigation in accordance with the activity-specific criteria.
Among other things, the greenhouse gas emissions o</data>
