contribution coming from the manufacture of batteries (0.9%). Taxonomy-aligned capital expenditures
(including acquisitions and excluding goodwill in accordance with the EU taxonomy) accounted for 3.7%
of the total investments reported in the Consolidated Financial Statements. A substantial contribution of
2.6% was identified with respect to capital expenditures for the manufac</data>
