      <data key="d3">a suitable replacement for an
existing product that does not meet the criteria for biodegradability. This resulted in established active
ingredients with multiple benefits for human health – such as ibuprofen – being assessed as not
taxonomy-aligned.

For more information on sales revenues, see Note 7 to the Consolidated Financial Statements from
page 358 onward. For more information on capital expenditures, see Note 14 to the Consolidated
Financial Statements from page 378 onward.

