Social

S1 Own Workforce1

ESRS S1

Our employees are crucial to BASF’s success. We want to attract and
retain talents for our company and support them in their development. We
also want to create a working environment that inspires and connects
people every day. This is founded on an open corporate culture of mutual
trust, respect and dedication to top performance.

ESRS 2 SBM</data>
