When identifying leadership talents, we also take into account the promotion and appreciation of
diversity, for example when it comes to women. Furthermore, we have committed to increasing the
proportion of women in leadership positions to 30% by 2030.4 As of December 31, 2024, the proportion
of women working in the BASF Group was 27.1%. The proportion of women in leadership po</data>
