In the following section, we discuss the material topics according to the results of our double materiality
assessment (see page 271).

Adequate wages
The Corporate Center’s Corporate Human Resources unit provides a globally consistent framework for
employee compensation. We offer our employees appropriate, performance-related and market-oriented
compensation, supplemented by attra</data>
    </node>
