The Corporate Center’s Corporate Human Resources unit provides a globally consistent framework for
employee skill development and leadership excellence. A Group-wide requirement defines our process
for employee development and the corresponding instruments and responsibilities. It also defines the
degree of freedom the divisions have in this process in order to ensure comparabl</data>
    </node>
