      <data key="d3">ted in a Group-wide requirement how BASF defines excellent leadership based on our
values and what behavior we expect from our leaders. We thus place particular emphasis on the desired
leadership behavior in our leadership development and assessment.

We are currently adjusting our corporate requirements for leadership and employee development to
reflect our new strategy. We are monitoring the implementation of these requirements through regular
surveys of employees and leaders. This also provid</data>
