Occupational safety and health

S1-1  S1-14

We regard health and safety as our highest priorities and are aware of the material potential negative
effects for our employees. To that end, the Corporate Center’s Corporate Environmental Protection,
Health, Safety &amp; Quality unit sets globally binding standards for occupational safety and health. Our
safety and health management in</data>
