for our employees to a minimum (see page 287). We have comprehensive actions in place for this, which
are described from page 285 onward.

» For more information on occupational health and safety, see basf.com/health

Secure employment

S1-1

The Corporate Center’s Corporate Human Resources unit is responsible for the aforementioned
requirements regarding the BASF International Labor and Social Standards. These apply globally, and all
leaders and employees are expected to comply with th</data>
