Clearly defined working conditions
A clearly defined and mutually agreed-upon employment relationship forms the foundation of a fair and
trusting collaboration between the company and its employees. It should establish the rights and
responsibilities of both parties, helping to prevent conflicts and misunderstandings. Our goal is to inform
employees in an easily accessible and </data>
