      <data key="d2">279</data>
      <data key="d3">Trust-based cooperation with employee representatives is an essential component of our corporate
culture (see page 23). Our open and ongoing dialog lays the foundation for balancing the interests of
BASF and our employees, even in challenging situations. Dialog formats differ depending on region and
the subject matter of the discussion. There are dedicated committees that discuss topics identified as
material in the sense of the ESRSs. Employee representatives are involved according to local leg</data>
    </node>
