collective agreement for the chemical industry in Germany, in which BASF representatives took part, to
be a positive result of this dialog. The BASF Europa Betriebsrat (BASF Works Council

Europe) addresses
cross-border matters in Europe. In South America, we foster the dialog with employee representatives in
the Diálogo Social. It most recently took place in 2023, and the next exchange is scheduled for early
2025.

BASF Report 2024 </data>
