Adequate wages
Adequate compensation is an important component of the package we offer to employees that makes us
a compelling choice as employer. Our central action in this area is our annual review of our
compensation levels worldwide using external market data, among other things. This allows us to aim for
market-oriented and appropriate compensation in the respective countr</data>
