      <data key="d2">282</data>
      <data key="d3">hese benefits exceed legal requirements and include, for example, company pension benefits,
supplementary health insurance and share programs. We oversee implementation of our requirements
regarding compensation through the processes described below.

According to defined globally consistent criteria, positions are assigned BASF job grades independent of
individuals; these form the basis for compensation. Job grades are assigned according to the demands
of the respective function. In this way, w</data>
