In the annual employee dialog, employees and leaders can discuss performance over the past year and
expectations for the current year (see page 283). Employees and leaders determine what level of detail is
necessary when the results are recorded.

We are committed to the U.N. Global Compact’s goal of paying our employees a living wage to support
them and their families by 2030. To this end, we review on a regular basis whether employees around the
world receive a wage sufficient to cover the</data>
