Skill development, training and further education
At BASF, we consider learning and development to be key success factors in retaining and improving the
required skills and expertise of employees. In this way, we also want to counter the risks associated with
insufficient skill development and employee turnover in the context of demographic change (see
page 271). Our skill deve</data>
