      <data key="d3">expectations and can also agree on development
objectives and individual learning needs. Learning goals should be adapted to the specific job
requirements and the employee’s development needs. Learning can take place in various formats and
locations.

BASF provides global access to a wide range of training offers on various learning platforms to support
employees in expanding their skills flexibly and thus acquire additional competencies. Furthermore,
numerous local and specialized academies off</data>
