      <data key="d3">pment potential and goals of employees in the
respective unit are discussed and possible development steps are defined. The main focal point is the
development of potential leaders and employees who qualify for positions in other operating divisions.

To support employees in the context of demographic change and rapidly shifting skill requirements, we
piloted the Skill Transformation Project in selected divisions of the company in Germany in 2024. The
focus was on promoting current skills and pr</data>
