Occupational safety and health
To prevent potential negative effects on the health and safety of our employees and prevent work-related
injuries, for example, we require and promote risk-conscious and safe working practices, learning from
incidents and the ongoing exchange of experiences. We are constantly refining and enhancing our global
requirements and training offers. In a</data>
