responsibilities. Newly appointed senior executives must attend a one-time mandatory dialog on health,
safety and environmental protection with the head of the Corporate Center’s Corporate Environmental
Protection, Health, Safety &amp; Quality unit.

Our global network enables the continuous exchange of information and findings within the
BASF Group. To further improve our processes and methods, we analyze accidents and potential
incidents and share knowledge and best practices within our globa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="BASF SE - 2024 - BASF Report (SustainabilityReports.com).pdf:page_286:chunk_1">
