with employee representatives in the course of approving the Employee Voices questionnaire regarding
the design of the engagement index.

We set ourselves the target of achieving employee engagement of more than 80%. More than 90,000
employees worldwide participated in the survey in 2024 (participation rate: 78%). The survey showed
global engagement of 79%, which is stable compared wi</data>
