We set ourselves concrete global targets regarding the potential negative impacts on the health and
safety of all employees, which we measure annually:

In 2023, we adjusted our occupational safety target and the corresponding reporting in accordance with
a Group-wide definition to focus on the number of worldwide High Severity Work Process Related
Injuries (HSI). We committed to a global HSI rate </data>
