      <data key="d3">ulation is weighted according to the relative share of employees in global
headcount. We aim to achieve a global value of more than 0.9 every year. The baseline from 2018 is
0.96. With an HPI of 0.97, we once again achieved this in 2024 (2023: 0.96).

For more information on data collection for HPI, see General Disclosures on page 150. The objective of
the HPI was developed by BASF based on the requirements of the Global Reporting InitiativeTM (GRI) and
was first established in 2011. The HPI was</data>
