      <data key="d2">294</data>
      <data key="d3">reation of information and training offerings, among
other things. Relevant aspects of human rights topics are also part of the global qualification guidelines
for security personnel and are incorporated into the standard agreements with contractors.

We use our Human Rights Advisory Council to access additional external human rights expertise. The
council, which comprises independent international human rights experts, meets regularly. The trust-
based dialog on human rights challenges helps us</data>
    </node>
