Our Procurement organization has set out guidelines for our upstream supply chain in a global, risk-
based management system; these specify how we implement our due diligence processes. We have
defined the standards for this in a global requirement. We continuously enhance our structures and
processes so as to reflect changes in the general situation. Procurement requirements a</data>
    </node>
