      <data key="d2">298</data>
      <data key="d3">ect area; this involves a variety of stakeholder
groups including 2,100 workers. The goal of the project is to achieve tangible improvements with respect
to increasing wages and avoiding child labor in the vegetable seeds business by the end of 2025.

Renewable raw materials
Palm oil, palm kernel oil and their derivatives are some of our most important renewable raw materials;
these are described in detail under E4 Biodiversity and Ecosystems (see pages 240 and 241). Based on
our Supplier Code o</data>
    </node>
