Actions

S3-4

In order to mitigate negative impacts and risks while simultaneously seizing opportunities in connection
with affected communities along our value chains, we take concrete actions, which we explain below on
the basis of the material subtopics for this chapter. These actions often entail decentralized measures,
projects and initiatives that are not assigned to any</data>
