September 2024. At this meeting, representatives of our suppliers and of NGOs from South Africa and
Germany, as well as other experts, held a constructive discussion on the environmental and human
rights-related situation.

Moreover, we take further measures designed to minimize BASF’s negative impacts on affected
communities and support positive impacts.

Actions to avoid potential adverse effects on health

We take numerous actions to design products in such a way t</data>
