Strategy and governance

ESRS 2 GOV-1

Our values, corporate principles and guidelines are firmly anchored in our Corporate Governance. The
Board of Executive Directors is responsible for ensuring that the company’s activities comply with the
applicable legislation and regulatory requirements as well as internal corporate requirements and ethical
business practices. This includ</data>
