Compliance Program, corporate values and Code of Conduct

G1-1

Our Compliance Program is based on our corporate values and voluntary commitments as well as
applicable international standards. We are convinced that compliance with these principles plays a key
role in ensuring our company’s long-term success. The global program describes our commitment to
responsible conduct and</data>
