1.3 Group accounting principles

Scope of consolidation: The scope of consolidation is based on the application of the standards IFRS
10 and 11 and IAS 28.

According to IFRS 10, a group consists of a parent entity and the subsidiaries controlled by the parent.
“Control” of an investee assumes the simultan</data>
    </node>
