This showed that all important value chains can compete in their respective markets and that the majority
of plants at the Ludwigshafen site are competitive in the short to long term.

Climate-related risks are taken into account in estimates and discretionary decisions when preparing the
Consolidated Financial Statements. Transition and physical risks are assessed on an ongoing basis and
can, for example, have an impact on usefu</data>
