      <data key="d2">379</data>
      <data key="d3">About This Report         Combined Management’s Report      Consolidated Financial Statements          Further Information

intended use. Borrowing costs were calculated based on a rate of 2.25% (previous year: 1.75%). All
other borrowing costs are recognized as an expense in the period in which they are incurred.

Government grants: Government grants for the acquisition or construction of property, plant and
equipment reduce the acquisition or construction cost of the respective assets (net met</data>
