Subscribed capital

BASF SE has only issued fully paid-up registered shares with no par value. There are no preferential
rights or other restrictions.

The subscribed capital of BASF SE as of December 31, 2024 and December 31, 2023, was
€1,142 million, divided into 892,522,164 qualifying shares with no par value.

