rehabilitating contaminated sites, recultivating landfills, removal of environmental contamination at
existing production or storage sites, and for similar measures as well as for obligations to surrender
emission certificates.

Provisions for employee obligations primarily consist of variable compensation including associated
social security contributions, as well as obligations for granting long-service bonuses. The latter are
predominantly calculated based on actuarial </data>
