23 Risks from litigation and claims

ESRS 2 SBM-3

Since 2019, numerous lawsuits filed by individuals claiming personal injury or by municipalities or states
claiming property or natural resource damages for alleged contamination of public and private water
supplies through per-fluorinated and polyfluorinated alkyl compounds (PFAS) have been pending against
members of BASF </data>
