Financial guarantees of the BASF Group are contracts that require compensation payments to be made
to the guarantee holder if a debtor fails to make payment when due under the terms of a transaction
entered into with the holder of the guarantee. Fin</data>
    </node>
    <node id="BASF SE - 2024 - BASF Report (SustainabilityReports.com).pdf:page_415:chunk_3">
