material currency risks were hedged. Appreciation or depreciation of the respective functional currency
would not have had a significant impact on BASF's income before income taxes or equity.

Interest rate risks: Interest rate risks arise from changes in prevailing market interest rates, which can
lead to changes in the fair value of fixed-rate instruments and in interest payments for variable-rate
instruments. Interest rate swaps and c</data>
