      <data key="d3">rticipate in the LTI programs.

Strive!

Strive! is based on a performance share plan and takes into account the achievement of strategic goals
and the development of the BASF share and dividend (total shareholder return) over a period of four
years.

Participation in Strive! is voluntary for senior executives and is linked to a share ownership obligation.
Strive! offers rolling eligibility, without a deadline for participation. In 2024, 628 people (previous year:
684 people) were eligible to pa</data>
