within the company, in spite of the many changes it involves, pay testament to this assessment. The
Supervisory Board will continue to closely monitor the implementation of the measures proposed.

The Supervisory Board places great value on good corporate governance. It fulfills all legal and other
requirements with regard to its composition, competencies and independence. The Annual Shareholders’
Meeting elected Tamara Weinert as the succes</data>
