Training measures

Individual onboarding sessions are held for the new members of the Supervisory Board to familiarize
them with corporate governance at BASF, the organization, the business processes and internal
structures of the BASF Group, and the composition of its businesses and their strategies. Above and
beyond this, the company also supports the members of the Supe</data>
