      <data key="d3">h excipients like emulsifiers,
stabilizers and other inactive components in order to improve the applicability and effectiveness of
various products, such as cosmetics, pharmaceuticals, agricultural chemicals, paints and coatings.

J

Just transition

Just transition refers to a concept for a socially just transformation of a social and economic order
toward climate neutrality. To this end, ecological, economic and social challenges are to be given equal
consideration, with a particular focus on</data>
    </node>
