P

Peak sales potential

The peak sales potential of the Agricultural Solutions pipeline describes the total peak sales forecast for
individual products in the research and development pipeline. Peak sales are the highest sales value to
be expected from one year. The pipeline comprises innovative products that have been on the market
since 2024 or will be launched on the m</data>
    </node>
