consumption
of fossil raw
materials

Raw materials – whether fossil or renewable –
are essential for our production and must be
used efficiently and responsibly. Ideally, we
keep them in the production cycle for as long as
possible in order to slow down the consumption
of natural resources, thus protecting the
environment.</data>
