      <data key="d2">9</data>
      <data key="d3">erials company that enhances the quality of life in a material way. The Company's
impact is evidenced by recycling technology that allows for waste to be used as building blocks in several Eastman products, branded with "Renew". As a
global specialty

materials company, management continuously evaluates the Company's business and operations to improve cost structure, increase
investment in growth, and strengthen execution capabilities, including specific initiatives to transform operations, work</data>
    </node>
