      <data key="d3">emissions by 30 percent by 2035, measured from the Company's 2017 baseline year, in order to achieve net-zero operations by 2050, and to innovate to
provide products that enable energy savings and GHG emissions reductions to customers and end-users.

Eastman focuses on the triple challenge of climate change, plastic waste, and a growing population through its aligned innovation pillars of Circularity,
Caring for Society, and Climate. Examples of Eastman sustainable solutions within identified di</data>
    </node>
