Eastman is positioned to enhance the quality of life in a material way with its sustainable solutions. The Company's expertise and scalability within the
Circular Economy platform allows true material to material recycling with an infinite loop and no compromise to quality. The Company's technologies
create virgin equivalent drop-in replacements for existing products by breaking down hard-to-recycle plastic waste feedstock to a molecular level and
upcycling it back to food-gra</data>
