Overview

In the AFP segment, the Company manufactures materials for products in the food, feed, and agriculture; transportation; water treatment and energy;
personal care and wellness; building and construction; consumables; and durables and electronics end-markets. Key technology platforms are cellulosic
biopolymers, polyester polymers, alkylamine derivatives, and propylene derivatives.

