Strategy

Management applies the innovation-driven growth model to the Fibers segment by leveraging its strong customer relationships and industry knowledge to
maintain a leading industry position in the global market. The segment benefits from a state-of-the-art, world class, acetate flake production facility at the
Kingsport, Tennessee site, which is supplied from Eastman's vertically integrated gasification facility and is the largest and most integrated acetate tow
site in</data>
    </node>
