Sources and Availability of Raw Materials and Energy

Eastman purchases a majority of its key raw materials and energy through different contract mechanisms, generally of one to three years in initial
duration, with renewal or cancellation options for each party. Most of these agreements do not require the Company to purchase materials or energy if its
operations are reduced or idle. The cost of raw materials and energy is generally based on market price at the time of purchas</data>
    </node>
