Risk Management and Strategy

Cybersecurity is an integral part of the Company's overall risk management program. The Company takes a comprehensive approach to cybersecurity,
involving key stakeholders in oversight and decision-making processes.

The Company utilizes a risk-based, multi-layered information security strategy based on the US NIST and ISO 27001 to assess, identify, and manage
risks from cybersecurity threats. This approach includes: (i) dedicated security operations center mon</data>
    </node>
