      <data key="d2">37</data>
      <data key="d3">owners, members, or participants); 2) have discrete financial information available; and 3) be reviewed regularly by Company
operating segment management. The Company aggregates certain components into reporting units based on economic similarities.

An impairment is recognized when the reporting unit's estimated fair value is less than its carrying value. The Company elected to perform a qualitative
impairment assessment of goodwill in 2025. The qualitative assessment identified three reporting</data>
    </node>
