on March 13, 2026. Both dividends and share repurchases are key strategies employed by the Company to return value to its stockholders.

INFLATION

In recent years, Eastman has experienced significant volatility attributed to inflation, deflation, and other factors. The cost of raw materials is generally
based on market prices, although derivative instruments are utilized, as appropriate, to m</data>
