      <data key="d2">66</data>
      <data key="d3">han one year. Finally, the Company does
not disclose any unfulfilled obligations as customer purchase order commitments have an original expected duration of one year or less and no
consideration from customers is excluded from the transaction price.

The timing of Eastman's customer billings does not always match the timing of revenue recognition. When the Company is entitled to bill a customer in
advance of the recognition of revenue, a contract liability is recognized. When the Company is not</data>
    </node>
