For additional information, see Note 20, "Segment and Regional Sales Information".

Pension and Other Postretirement Benefits

Eastman maintains defined benefit pension and other postretirement benefits plans that provide eligible employees with retirement benefits. The
estimated amounts of the costs and obligations related to these benefits reflect the Company's assumptio</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Eastman Chemical Co - 2025 - Annual Report (SustainabilityReports.com).pdf:page_67:chunk_1">
