the substantive vesting period.

For additional information, see Note 18, "Share-Based Compensation Plans and Awards".

Restructuring of Operations

Eastman records restructuring charges for costs incurred in connection with consolidation of operations, exited business or product lines, or shutdowns of
specific sites that are expected to be substantially completed within twelve months. These res</data>
