weighted average cost of capital ("WACC") plus a risk premium.

For additional information, see Note 5, "Goodwill and Other Intangible Assets".

Leases

There are two types of leases: financing and operating. Both types of leases have associated right-to-use assets and lease liabilities that are valued at the
net present value of the lease payments and recognized on the Consolidated Statements of F</data>
