Credit Facility, Term Loans, and Commercial Paper Borrowings

The Company has access to a $1.50 billion revolving credit agreement (the "Credit Facility"), in which borrowings under the Credit Facility are subject to
interest at varying spreads above quoted market rates and a commitment fee is paid on the tot</data>
    </node>
